{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"573001860a39f8a8","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured and unstructured)\n\n#### dataset fields\n(one column inside a dataset)\n```json\n{\n  \"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n  \"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n  \"field_name\": \"<name>\",\n  \"field_type\": \"structured|unstructured\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"sensitivity\": {},\n  \"format_specifiers\": {},\n  \"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"created_by\": \"\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"updated_by\": \"\"\n}\n\n```","x":108,"y":-636,"width":660,"height":580},
		{"id":"b1ff9090bc760430","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n\n#### dataset relationship\n\n```json\n\"relationship_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"source\": {   //table-table, table-column\n\t\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"storage_name\": \"<storage name>\",\n\t\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"field_name\": \"<field name>\",\n},\n\"target\": {\n\t\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"storage_name\": \"<storage name>\",\n\t\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"field_name\": \"<field name>\",\n},\n\"relationship_scope\": \"Intra/Inter\",\n\"relationship\": \"foreign_key\",\n\"relationship_type\": \"one-to-one\",\n\"confidence_score\": 0.85,\n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n```","x":868,"y":-636,"width":524,"height":656},
		{"id":"c91d442fd08ccba2","type":"text","text":"```json\n\"format_specifiers\": {\n  \"data_type\": \"string|integer|decimal|date|timestamp|boolean\",\n  \"nullable\": true,\n  \"max_length\": 255,\n  \"is_primary_key\": false,\n  \"is_foreign_key\": false,\n  \"is_unique\": true,\n  \"distinct_count\": 12000,\n  \"null_count\": 50,\n  \"sample_values\": [\"A123\", \"B456\"]\n}\n\n```","x":-252,"y":248,"width":580,"height":388},
		{"id":"b53dcdcf74667fd1","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured and unstructured)\n### dataset\n```json\n{\n  \"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n  \"dataset_name\": \"<logical_name>\",\n  \"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n  \"storage_name\": \"<storage name>\",\n  \"dataset_type\": \"structured|unstructured\",\n  \"file_extension\": \"csv|xlsx|pdf|jpg|mp4|RD\",\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"format_specifiers\": {},\n  \"input_info\": {},\n  \"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"created_by\": \"\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"updated_by\": \"\"\n}\n\n```","x":-840,"y":-636,"width":620,"height":580},
		{"id":"55fb8058ca6c1b35","type":"text","text":"```json\n\"format_specifiers\": {\n  \"layout_type\": \"single_table|multi_sheet\",\n  \"has_header\": true,\n  \"record_count\": 15000,\n  \"field_count\": 24,\n}\n\n```","x":-1400,"y":248,"width":479,"height":232},
		{"id":"c7bfdc030e388e3d","type":"text","text":"```json\n\"format_specifiers\": {\n  \"image_width\": 1920,\n  \"image_height\": 1080,\n  \"color_mode\": \"rgb\",\n  \"channels\": 3,\n  \"dpi\": 300\n}\n\n```","x":-840,"y":220,"width":420,"height":288},
		{"id":"b08306720e673baa","type":"text","text":"```json\n\"format_specifiers\": {\n  \"extraction_method\": \"speech_to_text\",\n  \"language\": \"en\",\n  \"confidence_score\": 0.91\n}\n\n```","x":400,"y":248,"width":501,"height":205},
		{"id":"013cd445f3e82677","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n### dataset\n```json\n{\n  \"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n  \"dataset_name\": \"<logical_name>\",\n  \"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n  \"storage_name\": \"<storage name>\",\n  \"dataset_type\": \"structured|unstructured\",\n  \"file_extension\": \"csv|xlsx|pdf|jpg|mp4|RD\",\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"format_specifiers\": {\n\t  \"layout_type\": \"single_table|multi_sheet\",\n\t  \"has_header\": true,\n\t  \"record_count\": 15000,\n\t  \"field_count\": 24,\n\t},\n  \"input_info\": {},\n  \"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"created_by\": \"\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"updated_by\": \"\"\n}\n\n```","x":-1440,"y":1200,"width":960,"height":680},
		{"id":"4d55208dbf66536a","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n\n#### dataset fields\n(one column inside a dataset)\n```json\n{\n  \"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n  \"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n  \"field_name\": \"<name>\",\n  \"field_type\": \"structured|unstructured\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"sensitivity\": {},\n  \"format_specifiers\": {\n\t  \"data_type\": \"string|integer|decimal|date|timestamp|boolean\",\n\t  \"nullable\": true,\n\t  \"max_length\": 255,\n\t  \"is_primary_key\": false,\n\t  \"is_foreign_key\": false,\n\t  \"is_unique\": true,\n\t  \"distinct_count\": 12000,\n\t  \"null_count\": 50,\n\t  \"sample_values\": [\"A123\", \"B456\"]\n\t},\n  \"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"created_by\": \"\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"updated_by\": \"\"\n}\n\n```","x":-412,"y":1200,"width":852,"height":780},
		{"id":"d5a9c27a4e12ef93","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n\n#### dataset relationship\n\n```json\n\"relationship_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"source\": {   //table-table, table-column\n\t\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"storage_name\": \"<storage name>\",\n\t\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"field_name\": \"<field name>\",\n},\n\"target\": {\n\t\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"storage_name\": \"<storage name>\",\n\t\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"field_name\": \"<field name>\",\n},\n\"relationship_scope\": \"Intra/Inter\",\n\"relationship\": \"foreign_key\",\n\"relationship_type\": \"one-to-one\",\n\"confidence_score\": 0.85,\n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n```","x":520,"y":1200,"width":524,"height":656},
